      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MR. TEDDY BEAR (1) wasn't far away at the finish when 4th and beaten only 4.5 lengths (30.15) at this track. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and five minor placings to his credit. Worth another chance. PRINCESS LASS (7) turned in a fair 4th placed finish last time at Warragul over 460m (26.46). Form here at the trip sound including two wins. Goes well out of this box with a win and six minor placings. Can do much better this time. ROWDY BOY (2) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (31.12) last time in a Grade 5 at The Meadows. Still to record a win from this draw but has never missed the frame in three starts. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. ASTON JOPLIN (3) was out of the money at this circuit last start but can atone.",
